{"id":"en_bow-down-my-great-aunt-is-back","title":"Bow Down, My Great-Aunt Is Back!","titleEn":"Bow Down, My Great-Aunt Is Back!","description":"Emily Douglas was a cultivation prodigy who, at just eight years old, became a disciple of the Celestial Seer and trained at the Heavenly Sect. Within a mere 81 days she had grown invincible, but her master then revealed a startling truth: a single day in the sect corresponds to a full year in the mortal world. So although she appears to be eight, Emily is in fact 88 years old. When she returns home, she discovers that her cousin has become an elderly man and that her friends have likewise aged. Their reunion sets the stage for an extraordinary journey. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/bow-down-my-great-aunt-is-back/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/bow-down-my-great-aunt-is-back/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Competition","Drama","Family Drama","Goofy","Morals & Ethics","The Chosen One"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doq9a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_bow-down-my-great-aunt-is-back_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doq9a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bow-down-my-great-aunt-is-back_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doq9a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bow-down-my-great-aunt-is-back_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7doq9a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_bow-down-my